@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title WF-2: Detection Engine Flow (v3.3 - Async via Outbox + HTTP)

participant "Core App" as CA #DAE8FC
database "core-db" as CDB #F5F5F5
participant "Outbox\nPoller" as OP #FFE6CC
participant "Detection Engine\n(port 8001)" as DE #FFF2CC
database "detection-db" as DDB #F5F5F5
participant "ML Service\n(port 8002)" as ML #E1D5E7
database "ml-service-db" as MDB #F5F5F5

== Phase 1: Login + Outbox Event ==

note over CA, CDB
  Sau khi login thành công (WF-1)
  Core App INSERT outbox_events
  (KHÔNG gọi detection sync)
end note

CA -> CDB : INSERT outbox_events\n(aggregate_type=login_attempt,\nevent_type=LoginEvent,\npayload={user_id, ip, ua, ...})
activate CDB
deactivate CDB

CA --> CA : Trả 200 cho User\n(đã xong phần core-app)

== Phase 2: Outbox Polling ==

OP -> CDB : SELECT outbox_events\nWHERE status='pending'\nLIMIT 100
activate CDB
CDB --> OP : [LoginEvent, ...]
deactivate CDB

OP -> OP : status=processing
OP -> CDB : UPDATE outbox_events SET status=processing
deactivate CDB

== Phase 3: HTTP Push to Detection Engine ==

OP -> DE : **POST /api/v1/internal/login-events**\n(event_id, user_id, username_attempted,\noutcome, ip, ua, timestamp)\n+ Internal-Secret header
activate DE

DE -> DE : Validate Internal-Secret
DE -> DE : Check event_id idempotency

alt event ALREADY PROCESSED
    DE --> OP : **200 OK** {deduplicated: true}
    deactivate DE
else NEW event
    DE -> DDB : INSERT login_attempts\n(event_id, user_id, outcome, ip, ua,\ntimestamp, status=pending)
    activate DDB
    deactivate DDB
    DE --> OP : **202 Accepted** {login_attempt_id}
    deactivate DE
end

OP -> CDB : UPDATE outbox_events\n(status=published, published_at=NOW())

== Phase 4: Detection Pipeline (Background Worker) ==

note over DE, DDB
  Detection Engine Worker
  poll login_attempts WHERE status='pending'
end note

DE -> DDB : SELECT login_attempts\nWHERE status='pending'\nORDER BY timestamp
activate DDB
DDB --> DE : [pending attempts]
deactivate DDB

loop for each pending attempt
    DE -> DDB : UPDATE login_attempts\n(status=processed)
    
    == Rule Evaluation ==
    DE -> DE : Load active policy
    DE -> DE : Calculate rule_score\n(IP new? fail_count? new_device?\nunusual_hour? new_country? VPN/Tor?)
    DE -> DDB : INSERT detection_logs\n(stage=rule_evaluation,\nrule_name, triggered, score_contribution)
    
    == ML Scoring (Xem WF-6 chi tiết) ==
    DE -> ML : **POST /api/v1/internal/ml/score**\n(features_vector)
    activate ML
    ML --> DE : {anomaly_score, is_anomaly,\nreason_codes, model_version}
    deactivate ML
    
    == Combine Scores ==
    DE -> DE : combined_score =\n0.4 × rule_score + 0.6 × ml_score
    DE -> DE : risk_level =\nLOW < 0.25 < MEDIUM < 0.5 < HIGH < 0.75 < CRITICAL
    
    DE -> DDB : INSERT risk_assessments\n(login_attempt_id, rule_score, ml_score,\ncombined_score, risk_level, decision)
    
    == Action Decision ==
    alt risk_level IN (HIGH, CRITICAL)
        DE -> DDB : INSERT alerts\n(login_attempt_id, status=open,\nrisk_level, detection_reason,\ndetection_scores)
        DE -> DDB : INSERT detection_logs\n(stage=action_sent,\ndetails={action: ALERT_CREATED})
    else risk_level IN (LOW, MEDIUM)
        DE -> DDB : INSERT detection_logs\n(stage=action_sent,\ndetails={action: NO_ALERT})
    end
    
    == Optional: Send Action back to Core ==
    alt risk_level = CRITICAL + LOCK_USER action
        DE -> CA : **POST /api/v1/internal/actions**\n(action=LOCK_USER, target=user_id,\nreason, login_attempt_id)\n+ Internal-Secret
        activate CA
        CA -> CDB : UPDATE users SET status=locked
        CA --> DE : **200 OK**
        deactivate CA
    end
end

note over DE
  **v3.3 Key Points:**
  - Login KHÔNG block chờ detection
  - Outbox pattern đảm bảo reliability
  - HTTP giữa Core ↔ Detection Engine
  - Detection Engine tự quản lý login_attempts
  - ML Service được gọi qua HTTP riêng
end note

@enduml
